data: {"id": "6d6c5ece25ac4b45-thinking-parallel_evidence-1441", "run_id": "6d6c5ece25ac4b45", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "已根据 `layer_handoff` 指定实体 `aiops-case-08/workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr` 完成首轮采集。\n\n**实体与状态确认：**\n- Pod `workload-5c9c7b6489-wmjhr` 当前 `phase: Running`，但 `containerStatuses` 显示 `Ready: False` 且处于 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态（重启 11 次）。\n- 容器镜像为 `xnet.registry.io:8443/observability/python:3-alpine`，启动命令为 `python3 /opt/aiops/server.py`。\n\n**事实证据采集：**\n\n1.  **支持 \"CrashLoopBackOffRuntime\" 且指向 \"OOMKilled\" 的证据：**\n    - **Exit Code 137**: `kubectl_get_yaml` 和 `kubectl_describe` 均显示容器退出码为 137（通常代表 SIGKILL）。\n    - **Reason ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1788801178410, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

